<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan's China Motor 1996 net down 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan's China Motor 1996 net down 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-December 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			     31,060 vs 40,415</p>
<p>    Net profit			    1,754 vs  2,213</p>
<p>NOTE: China Motor Co is one of Taiwan's two biggest car makers.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
